<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρ-έμφᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεμφαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not determinative</i> or <i>indicative,</i> c.
			gen., <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				239.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
				<u>in Phdr.</u>
				p.124A.
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>Aphr.<i>in.SE</i><i><span class="en">
				36.17
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀπαρέμφατος</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγκλισις</span>) the <i>infinitive mood</i>
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεμφατικός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				226.20
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i>Aphr.<i><span class="en">
				<u>in SE</u>
				34.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.204
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>in the infinitive mood,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγνῶναι</span> take <i>as an
				infinitive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				76.16
			</span></i>.</div>
